*** NickServ Operator Help - Command: AUTHRESET ***
Cancels a pending AUTH procedure on a nickname.
 
Syntax: AUTHRESET nickname [MAILCHANGE | DROP | RESETPASS]
 
No sub-command: full reset, nick back to unauthorized,
registered and pending E-Mail removed.
MAILCHANGE, DROP, RESETPASS: cancel only that pending
request, E-Mail and password untouched.
 
On a pending password reset use RESETPASS: a full reset
locks the owner out.
 
This command is limited to Services Help Operators.
*** End of OHelp ***
